 "about": "Operations and whether their shape is acceptable, for the two implementations of the contract: mirage_schema.ops (the policy and the responder) and cowrie.mirage_state (the SSH decoy). Both must give every case its verdict. A string '@repeat:X:N' stands for X written N times.",
